p Arkin (VMWare acquired) was a NexusVP funded startup providing datacenters with a single pane of glass into their entire networking infrastructure.

p(class="bb b--lightest-blue pb3") I helped it over the course of two years move from a interface-less demo to being acquired by VMWare in 2016.

p The solution employed a search-first approach, utilizing visual topologies to delegate complex hierarchies, and a dashboard approach to render the information-heavy characterstics of a virtualized datacenter.

